    "The XLSX writer continues to refuse ambiguous empty enum labels without replacing the destination file.",
    "Calc and Gnumeric re-save XLSX through ODS and back to XLSX; both preserve the exact space-padded labels, keep SQL NULL blank, and create no formulas."
